Want to boost your beat sales with special offers? Beat22 has made it easy. You can enroll your beats into official Beat22 coupons that we’ve already curated.

### **What are coupon codes on Beat22?**

Coupon Codes allow you to offer discounts on your beats, helping drive more sales, attract new buyers, and reward loyal fans.

### **How to enroll and use coupon codes:**

1.  **Go to Your Dashboard** Log into your Beat22 seller account and head over to your dashboard. ****Click on Browse at the top****
    
    ![Go to Your Dashboard Log into your Beat22 seller account and head over to your dashboard. Click on Browse at](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-210101.png)
    
2.  ****Click on Coupons****
    
    ![Click on Coupons](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-210115.png)
    
3.  ******Click on whichever coupon you want to enroll******
    
    ![Click on whichever coupon you want to enroll](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-210127.png)
    
     
4.  ******Select the expiry date and choose the beat you want to offer discount on from your catalogue******
    
    ![Select the expiry date and choose the beat you want to offer discount on from your catalogue](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-210141.png)
    
     
5.  ****Click on “Enroll Coupon”****
6.  ****Once the coupon is enrolled, you'll see a coupon icon next to your beat name.****
